<title>USA: Brazil coffee areas seen free of damaging cold.</title>
<headline>Brazil coffee areas seen free of damaging cold.</headline>
<dateline>LEXINGTON, Mass. 1997-07-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>No damaging cold is in sight for the next five days in Brazil's coffee regions, independent forecaster Weather Services Corporation said.</p>
<p>Low temperatures on Friday and Saturday are seen at 52-66 degrees.</p>
<p>The outlook is for mild weather from Sunday through to Tuesday.</p>
</text>
